; A failing assertion is an error and moves no balance; the pad after it is sized
; from the true balance (165), not from what the failing assertion claimed (200).
option "operating_currency" "CNY"

1970-01-01 commodity CNY
1970-01-01 open Assets:A
1970-01-01 open Equity:Open
1970-01-01 open Income:X

2024-01-01 * "x" "income"
  Assets:A  165 CNY
  Income:X

2024-01-02 balance Assets:A  200 CNY

2024-01-02 pad Assets:A Equity:Open
2024-01-03 balance Assets:A  500 CNY

2024-01-04 balance Assets:A  500 CNY
